    "Your Bluesky account can live on another server (a PDS). Your followers, posts and handle history move with it; your Fediverse account here stays as it is. Afterwards this server no longer publishes to Bluesky for you." : "Vaš Bluesky nalog može da bude na drugom serveru (PDS). Vaši pratioci, objave i istorija identifikatora prelaze sa njim; vaš Fediverse nalog ovde ostaje kakav jeste. Nakon toga ovaj server više ne objavljuje na Bluesky umesto vas.",
    "Your Bluesky account now lives on {pds} as {handle}." : "Vaš Bluesky nalog je sada na {pds} kao {handle}.",
    "You, with your recovery phrase, and {host} control it now. This server no longer does." : "Sada ga kontrolišete vi, sa frazom za oporavak, i {host}. Ovaj server više ne.",
