    "Your Bluesky account is moved to {server}. This cannot be undone from here." : "Vaš Bluesky nalog se premešta na {server}. Ovo ne može da se poništi odavde.",
    "You have no recovery phrase: afterwards only {server} controls your Bluesky account." : "Nemate frazu za oporavak: nakon toga samo {server} kontroliše vaš Bluesky nalog.",
    "Move it" : "Premesti ga",
