    "_%n view_::_%n views_" : ["%n pregled","%n pregleda","%n pregleda"],
    "Could not delete your account" : "Vaš nalog nije mogao da se obriše",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Sve što ste objavili odavde se briše, vaši pratioci i ljudi koje pratite se puštaju, a svaki server koji je znao za ovaj nalog dobija obaveštenje da ga više nema. Ovo ne može da se poništi i posle toga nema načina da se išta vrati — prvo napravite arhivu pomoću dugmeta Izvezi iznad ako bi vam mogla zatrebati.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Vaš nalog na ovom serveru je napravljen za Aloha Social, pa se i on briše i bićete odjavljeni. Identifikator koji brišete zadržava se sat vremena, kako niko drugi ne bi mogao da ga uzme čim ga se odreknete.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Vaš Nextcloud nalog se ne dira: ostajete prijavljeni u sve ostalo i odmah možete da napravite novi Aloha Social nalog. Identifikator koji brišete zadržava se sat vremena, kako niko drugi ne bi mogao da ga uzme čim ga se odreknete, pa je novom nalogu potreban drugi.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Objava koja je već stigla na tuđi server briše se tako što se od tog servera traži da je obriše. Skoro svi to urade; nijedan ne može na to da se natera.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Obriši moj Aloha Social nalog",
