    "Could not read who you follow, so only your own island is drawn." : "Nije moglo da se pročita koga pratite, pa je nacrtano samo vaše ostrvo.",
    "Nobody you follow lives on another island yet. Find somebody with the search below, and a canoe route opens to theirs." : "Niko koga pratite još ne živi na drugom ostrvu. Pronađite nekoga pretragom ispod i otvoriće se kanu-ruta do njegovog ostrva.",
    "_You follow people on %n other island._::_You follow people on %n other islands._" : ["Pratite ljude na %n drugom ostrvu.","Pratite ljude na %n druga ostrva.","Pratite ljude na %n drugih ostrva."],
