    "Moving — it runs in the background, and this page shows where it gets to" : "Premeštanje — teče u pozadini, a ova stranica pokazuje dokle je stiglo",
    "Your followers are being told to follow {target}" : "Vašim pratiocima se javlja da prate {target}",
