    "A <link rel=\"me\"> in the page's <head> does the same, and rel=\"me noopener\" counts as well: the server looks for \"me\" among the rel words of any anchor or link on the page. The address has to be your own profile address, the one in the line above; a trailing slash or a #fragment makes no difference." : "<link rel=\"me\"> u <head> delu stranice radi isto, a i rel=\"me noopener\" se računa: server traži \"me\" među rel rečima bilo kog sidra ili linka na stranici. Adresa mora da bude adresa vašeg profila, ona u redu iznad; kosa crta na kraju ili #fragment ne menjaju ništa.",
    "This server fetches the page itself, in the background, at most once a day per account, over http or https only, and reads the first part of it. A page it cannot reach is left unverified and asked again later, and a page that stops linking back loses its tick." : "Ovaj server sam preuzima stranicu, u pozadini, najviše jednom dnevno po nalogu, samo preko http ili https, i čita njen prvi deo. Stranica do koje ne može da dođe ostaje neverifikovana i proverava se ponovo kasnije, a stranica koja prestane da uzvraća link gubi kvačicu.",
