    "One address per line. A relay is what carries this server's posts to the Bluesky apps; without one, a post written here is published and seen by nobody." : "Jedna adresa po redu. Relej je ono što prenosi objave ovog servera do Bluesky aplikacija; bez njega, objava napisana ovde je objavljena, ali je niko ne vidi.",
