    "Could not unsubscribe from that relay" : "Otkazivanje pretplate na taj relej nije uspelo",
    "What is shared is public posts and nothing else: a followers-only post has an audience that was chosen, and a relay is the opposite of a chosen audience. Nothing a person on this server writes privately ever reaches one." : "Deli se samo ono što je javno i ništa drugo: objava samo za pratioce ima izabranu publiku, a relej je suprotnost izabranoj publici. Ništa što osoba na ovom serveru napiše privatno nikada ne stiže do releja.",
    "The relay's address" : "Adresa releja",
    "Relays publish this address on their own front page; it usually ends in /actor or /inbox." : "Releji objavljuju ovu adresu na svojoj naslovnoj stranici; obično se završava sa /actor ili /inbox.",
