    "Tags" : "Oznake",
    "Could not open this pack. The server may be busy." : "Ovaj paket nije mogao da se otvori. Server je možda zauzet.",
    "What to discover" : "Šta otkriti",
    "Nothing to discover yet" : "Još nema ničega za otkrivanje",
    "All starter packs" : "Svi početni paketi",
    "Their server did not answer. Often it is only busy for a moment. If this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, some servers never answer it." : "Njihov server nije odgovorio. Često je samo zauzet na trenutak. Ako ovaj Nextcloud nije dostupan sa interneta, neki serveri mu nikada ne odgovaraju.",
    "No starter packs" : "Nema početnih paketa",
    "Your island and its neighbours" : "Vaše ostrvo i njegovi susedi",
    "Every server in the fediverse is an island. Following somebody on another one opens a canoe route to it, and their posts travel to you along that route." : "Svaki server na Fediverse-u je ostrvo. Praćenje nekoga na drugom otvara kanu-rutu do njega, a njegove objave putuju do vas tom rutom.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Pretraži Fediverse",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Imena i identifikatori u javnim imenicima, uključujući ljude na serverima koje ovaj nikada nije upoznao. Neko ko nije naveden pronalazi se po punom identifikatoru, kao @someone@example.org ili @someone.example.com, u pretrazi na vrhu bočne trake.",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Imena i identifikatori u javnim imenicima, uključujući ljude na serverima koje ovaj nikada nije upoznao. Neko ko nije naveden pronalazi se po punom identifikatoru, kao @someone@example.org, u pretrazi na vrhu bočne trake.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Zbog onih koje pratite",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "Ljudi koje pratite prate druge ljude. Ovo pita njihove servere koga, i stavlja na početak one koje ih više deli.",
    "Suggested on Bluesky" : "Predloženo na Bluesky-ju",
    "People Bluesky suggests to you, from who you follow there. Follow them here like anybody else." : "Ljudi koje vam Bluesky predlaže, na osnovu onih koje tamo pratite. Zapratite ih ovde kao i bilo koga drugog.",
    "People this server knows" : "Ljudi koje ovaj server zna",
    "Accounts on this Nextcloud, and the ones it has met through the people here." : "Nalozi na ovom Nextcloud-u i oni koje je upoznao preko ljudi ovde.",
    "On your Nextcloud" : "Na vašem Nextcloud-u",
    "Nobody here yet" : "Ovde još nema nikoga",
    "Accounts this server has met will appear here. Until it has met any, the search above asks other servers’ directories instead." : "Ovde će se pojaviti nalozi koje je ovaj server upoznao. Dok ne upozna nijedan, pretraga iznad umesto toga pita imenike drugih servera.",
    "Failed to load follow requests" : "Učitavanje zahteva za praćenje nije uspelo",
    "Failed to accept the follow request" : "Prihvatanje zahteva za praćenje nije uspelo",
