    "These figures are for the fediverse only. {networks} publishes no count of its accounts that could be quoted here, so it is not included." : "Ove brojke važe samo za fediverse. {networks} ne objavljuje broj svojih naloga koji bi mogao da se navede ovde, pa nije uključen.",
    "Translated by {provider}" : "Preveo {provider}",
    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Ostao je jedan korak, na vašem starom serveru: recite mu da premesti vaše pratioce ovde. Na Mastodon-u je to Podešavanja → Nalog → Premeštanje na drugi nalog; tamo unesite {handle}.",
